  "pep_request_action_note": "The FFI requested_action ABI (src/policy/policy_ir.zig `Action`, mirrored by ACTION_* in rust-src/lib.rs). Three ordinal spaces exist and none may be compared with another: policy_action_ordinals (BLOCK=2), pep_decision_ordinals (BLOCK=1) and this one (BLOCK=4). Convert, never cast.",
